# Network: upload and download rates, meeting at a centre bar.
Output assets/network.gif

Source demo/tapes/themes/nord.tape
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1320
Set Height 520
Set Padding 12
Set BorderRadius 10
Set Framerate 20
Set TypingSpeed 60ms

Hide
Type "gc-prepare --theme nord --layout horizontal --refresh 1 --history 120"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Type "clear"
Enter
Show

Type "gc --net"
Enter
Sleep 3s

Hide
Sleep 122s
Show

Sleep 18s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
